{"version":1,"content":"<p>Kioxia與戴爾合作打造一套單機架對象存儲系統，在標準42U機架中配置640塊Kioxia LC9系列245.76 TB固態硬盤，原始閃存容量達到約157 PB。系統運行戴爾軟件定義存儲平台ObjectScale，由16台PowerEdge R7725xd伺服器承載，面向人工智能訓練、大數據分析和雲原生應用等非結構化數據工作負載。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586214.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.069158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:07:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"bf145d19d9f63596970f65422109f69dea1218f52df2c498553bbbf1a7235f9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}